From 70eda3d4a5537fe538a01272ac468a71d333268c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WGS Extract AI <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:40:13 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Match google/deepvariant:1.10.0 make_examples on WGS
 (wgsextract #647)

- RealignerOptions.normalize_reads follows upstream's --normalize_reads
  default (false; true only for pangenome). Forcing it true moved reads
  Docker leaves at their original alignment.
- Count alleles only over realigned reads that still overlap the region,
  as upstream's in_memory_sam_reader.query(region); pileups keep all.
- libstdc++-compatible std::sort for FastPassAligner's haplotype order.
- gzip-compressed examples (examples.tfrecord@N.gz), read transparently;
  nucleus-style 'name@N.gz' shard specs; truncated records are fatal.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
